5) CPU and Memory Resource Management
BEGIN
    INPUT application_list
    FOR each app IN application_list DO
        CREATE cgroup for app
        SET CPU limit for app
        SET memory limit for app
        ASSIGN app process to cgroup
        MONITOR CPU usage
        MONITOR memory usage
        IF CPU usage > CPU limit THEN
            REDUCE CPU usage
        ENDIF
        IF memory usage > memory limit THEN
            REDUCE memory usage
        ENDIF
    ENDFOR
    DISPLAY "Resource management completed"
END
Take the list of applications.Create a cgroup for each application.
Set a limit for CPU usage.Set a limit for memory usage
Monitor the applications and control excessive usage to keep the system running smoothly.















